{"ticker":"ITW","updated":"2026-10-23T23:10:01Z","profile":{"longName":"Illinois Tool Works Inc.","shortName":"Illinois Tool Works Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.itw.com","fullTimeEmployees":43000,"marketCap":78533599232,"trailingPE":25.0,"forwardPE":22.338806,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.7685714,"pegRatio":2.59,"targetMeanPrice":294.57144,"targetHighPrice":326.0,"targetLowPrice":249.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.061,"earningsGrowth":0.101,"grossMargins":0.44162,"operatingMargins":0.26900998,"profitMargins":0.19393998,"totalRevenue":16469000192,"beta":0.975,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":303.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":238.82,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.46},"summary":"Illinois Tool Works Inc. provides industrial products and equipment in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and South America. It operates through seven segments: Automotive OEM; Food Equipment; Test & Measurement and Electronics; Welding; Polymers & Fluids; Construction Products; and Specialty Products. The Automotive OEM segment offers plastic and metal components, fasteners, and assemblies for automobiles, light trucks, and other industrial uses. The Food Equipment segment provides warewashing, cooking, refrigeration, and food processing equipment; kitchen exhaust, ventilation, and pollution control systems; and food equipment maintenance and repair services. The Test & Measurement and Electronics segment produce and sells test and measurement; and electronic manufacturing and maintenance, repair, and operations solutions. The Welding segment produces arc welding equipment, and metal arc welding consumables and related accessories. The Polymers & Fluids segment produces adhesives, sealants, lubrication and cutting fluids, and fluids and polymers for auto aftermarket maintenance and appearance. The Construction Products segment offers engineered fastening systems and solutions for the residential construction, renovation/remodel, and commercial construction markets. The Specialty Products segment provides beverage packaging equipment and consumabl","summary_zh":"伊利諾工具廠公司在北美、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和南美提供工業產品和設備。它透過七個部門運作：汽車 OEM 部門；食品設備；測試與測量及電子；焊接;聚合物和流體；建築產品；和特色產品。汽車 OEM 部門為汽車、輕型卡車和其他工業用途提供塑膠和金屬零件、緊固件和組件。食品設備部門提供餐具洗滌、烹飪、冷藏和食品加工設備；廚房排氣、通風和污染控制系統；以及食品設備維護和維修服務。測試與測量及電子部門生產和銷售測試與測量；以及電子製造和維護、維修和營運解決方案。焊接部門生產弧焊設備、金屬弧焊耗材及相關配件。聚合物和流體部門生產黏合劑、密封劑、潤滑和切削液，以及用於汽車售後維護和外觀的流體和聚合物。建築產品部門為住宅建築、翻新/改建和商業建築市場提供工程緊固系統和解決方案。特種產品部門提供飲料包裝設備及消耗品","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":269.48,"h":270.74,"l":266.47,"c":266.74,"v":691400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":266.7,"h":268.4,"l":265.58,"c":266.24,"v":1393400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":265.57,"h":268.25,"l":265.57,"c":266.83,"v":659400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":267.5,"h":268.0,"l":263.66,"c":265.75,"v":725300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":266.07,"h":267.15,"l":264.04,"c":264.65,"v":963400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":263.27,"h":263.27,"l":260.75,"c":262.26,"v":898300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":261.95,"h":262.43,"l":259.97,"c":261.25,"v":719100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":261.84,"h":265.76,"l":260.59,"c":265.67,"v":639300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":266.69,"h":268.68,"l":264.52,"c":266.24,"v":583100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":265.51,"h":266.91,"l":263.62,"c":266.68,"v":799200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":265.12,"h":265.6,"l":261.35,"c":262.18,"v":630900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":261.32,"h":264.57,"l":261.17,"c":262.55,"v":817300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":262.27,"h":266.93,"l":261.64,"c":266.37,"v":1040300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":265.28,"h":265.97,"l":262.93,"c":263.36,"v":668400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":264.57,"h":264.83,"l":262.54,"c":263.87,"v":801000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":262.99,"h":264.46,"l":261.06,"c":261.84,"v":828700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":262.71,"h":268.0,"l":261.8,"c":262.48,"v":963800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":262.75,"h":265.23,"l":262.28,"c":263.59,"v":698700},{"t":